  "_sText": "Credits:\r\n--------\r\nAK Body Model: Darkstorn\r\nAK Body Skin: Kimono, Darkstorn, Splinter, receiver skins edited by Isaac\r\nSynthetic Skin: Splinter\r\nAK UV-Maps: Bullet_Head & Darkstorn\r\n\r\nAK Magazine Model: N.R.\r\nAK Magazine Skin: Polygon, edited by Isaac\r\n\r\nAK-74 Compensator Model: N.R.\r\nAK-74 Compensator Skin: Dreadus\r\n\r\nSide Rail Model: TheLama\r\nSide Rail Skin: Sproily\r\n\r\nGP-30 Model: Twinke Masta\r\nGP-30 Skin: Pete\r\n\r\nCartridge in Magazine: Lonewolf\r\nVOG-25P Grenade: Pete\r\n\r\nImproved HEV/OP4/BS Arm Models: Ambient.Impact\r\nHEV Arm Skins: H4wK, wonrz\r\nOP4 Glove Skins: Gearbox, Unbreakable(Desert), Aydin(Worn)\r\nOP4 Arm Skin: Gearbox\r\nRemapping Skins to Gearbox UV: Toadie\r\nBS Arm Skins: H4wK\r\n\r\nAnimations: Toadie (<3)\r\nShooting Sound: from AK-74 in Global Warfare 1.5\r\nReloading Sound: Vunsunta\r\nGrenade Launcher Sound: from GP-25 in Firearms Mod 3.0\r\nSafety Sound: from Firearms 3.0\r\nSound Tweaks: N.R.\r\n\r\nRealistic Muzzleflash: from Firearms 3.0\r\nSprite edits: N.R.\r\n\r\n+-----------------------------------+\r\n| Hack/Compile: NovaRain (aka N.R.) |\r\n+-----------------------------------+",
